Operators on different factors commute. For example, $\sigma_x\tau_x\ket{uu}
=\ket{dd}
=\tau_x\sigma_x\ket{uu}.$ The same equality holds on every composite basis vector and therefore on every state: $[\sigma_m,\tau_n]=0
\qquad\text{for all }m,n.$

